T*
(PID-23-0013 PAGE 2 OF 3 - PIPING TOPOLOGY & PROCESS CONNECTIONS) Tj
T*
(- Line 4"-P-2302-316L \(Stream S229\): From Preflash Column V-2301 & Pump P-2301A/B to D-2304 Nozzle N1) Tj
T*
(- Line 1"-P-2311-316L \(Stream S310\): Sulfuric Acid Catalyst Feed through SIL-2 Shutdown Valve XV-1305 to D-2304) Tj
T*
(- Line 10"-P-2307-316L \(Stream S379\): From D-2304 Nozzle N2 via Circulation Pump P-2304A/B and Flow Meter FT-1304 to E-2307 Tube Inlet) Tj
T*
(- Line 10"-P-2308-316L \(Stream S380\): Cooled Recirculation Return from E-2307 Tube Outlet to D-2304 Nozzle N3) Tj
T*
(- Line 4"-P-2306-316L \(Stream S384\): Cleavage Product Effluent from D-2304 Nozzle N4 via Level Control Valve LV-1301 to Neutralization Drum D-2310) Tj
T*
(- Line 4"-P-2315-316L \(Stream S387\): Emergency Cumene Quench Header via SIL-2 Blowdown/Quench Valve XV-1309 to D-2304 Nozzle N5) Tj
